        A promotion is only one part of the decision. Review the provider profile, your legal rights, local rules, and complaint-data context before using a paid credit repair offer.
      </p>
      <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <a href="/financial-wellness/credit-repair-rights-fcra-croa/" class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-alt p-4 hover:border-primary/40">
          <span class="block text-sm font-semibold text-text">FCRA &amp; CROA Rights</span>
